{"4540340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixelora Tech Store", "steam_appid": 4540340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelora – Build Your Own Tech Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelora is a detailed business simulation where you start from scratch and grow your own technology store into a thriving empire. Beginning with a small shop, you’ll expand step by step, making the right decisions to turn your store into a major tech hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/5d9d8ee16b29c31f5ff74dfb310234cb.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves, set your prices, interact with customers, and experience every aspect of running a business. Every decision you make directly impacts the future of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/91b49ba8edca3377247f8f1efde0870e.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic and Dynamic Trading Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers from different parts of the city visit your store, each with unique needs, budgets, and interests. Market trends constantly change, and adapting to them is key to your success. Offer the right products at the right time to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/9c8b42a852b426554dbb214fa43a4faa.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active Gameplay Meets Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely around your store with your character and interact directly with customers. At the same time, use your in-game tablet to manage every aspect of your business with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/65e1c3556e71d7b7a1300e5cd80c1985.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Management Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pixelora, selling products is just the beginning. To succeed, you must handle multiple aspects of your business:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and manage your warehouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place purchased products on shelves and stands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with customers to complete sales</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track economic data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor environmental factors such as weather and time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your budget and payments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve customer traffic with strategic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from suppliers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow market trends and adjust your shelf layout accordingly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in assets such as Gold, Dollar, and Bitcoin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set product prices strategically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees (cashiers, sales staff, managers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train employees to improve their performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take bank loans when needed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run advertisements to increase customer flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor customer satisfaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire managers to support store operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements and earn rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/52aa8f0a41a5b594d24c72c3ec37d65b.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Decision Has Consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you end the month with negative finances, you go bankrupt and the game ends. But with the right strategy, success is within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear: Reach a total cash balance of 100,000,000 to successfully complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/35e3f79d34ca9278b047ba1be460f8de.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success or bankruptcy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Every decision you make will shape the future of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Pixelora now and start building your own business story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/b676efb9f50f09d284c1c87401770c0c.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelora – Build Your Own Tech Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelora is a detailed business simulation where you start from scratch and grow your own technology store into a thriving empire. Beginning with a small shop, you’ll expand step by step, making the right decisions to turn your store into a major tech hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/5d9d8ee16b29c31f5ff74dfb310234cb.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves, set your prices, interact with customers, and experience every aspect of running a business. Every decision you make directly impacts the future of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/91b49ba8edca3377247f8f1efde0870e.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic and Dynamic Trading Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers from different parts of the city visit your store, each with unique needs, budgets, and interests. Market trends constantly change, and adapting to them is key to your success. Offer the right products at the right time to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/9c8b42a852b426554dbb214fa43a4faa.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active Gameplay Meets Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely around your store with your character and interact directly with customers. At the same time, use your in-game tablet to manage every aspect of your business with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/65e1c3556e71d7b7a1300e5cd80c1985.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Management Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pixelora, selling products is just the beginning. To succeed, you must handle multiple aspects of your business:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and manage your warehouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place purchased products on shelves and stands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with customers to complete sales</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track economic data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor environmental factors such as weather and time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your budget and payments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve customer traffic with strategic upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from suppliers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow market trends and adjust your shelf layout accordingly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in assets such as Gold, Dollar, and Bitcoin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set product prices strategically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees (cashiers, sales staff, managers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train employees to improve their performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take bank loans when needed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run advertisements to increase customer flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor customer satisfaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire managers to support store operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements and earn rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/52aa8f0a41a5b594d24c72c3ec37d65b.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Decision Has Consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you end the month with negative finances, you go bankrupt and the game ends. But with the right strategy, success is within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear: Reach a total cash balance of 100,000,000 to successfully complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/35e3f79d34ca9278b047ba1be460f8de.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success or bankruptcy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Every decision you make will shape the future of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Pixelora now and start building your own business story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540340/extras/b676efb9f50f09d284c1c87401770c0c.avif?t=1786606517\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build, manage, and grow your own tech store! Sell products, interact with customers, follow market trends, and make the right decisions to create your empire. Every choice shapes your future in Pixelora.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</str